.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC
.Dd October 24, 2026
.Dt MBT_HOLEPUNCH 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mbt_hp_encode ,
.Nm mbt_hp_decode ,
.Nm mbt_hp_type_str ,
.Nm mbt_hp_error_str
.Nd BEP 55 holepunch message codec
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In mbt/holepunch.h
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_hp_encode "const struct mbt_hp_msg *msg" "void *buf" "size_t cap"
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_hp_decode "const void *buf" "size_t len" "struct mbt_hp_msg *msg"
.Ft const char *
.Fn mbt_hp_type_str "enum mbt_hp_type type"
.Ft const char *
.Fn mbt_hp_error_str "uint32_t err"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These functions convert between
.Vt struct mbt_hp_msg
and the binary payload of a BEP 55
.Dq ut_holepunch
extension message, the bytes after the BEP 10 extended message header.
.Bd -literal
struct mbt_hp_msg {
	enum mbt_hp_type type;
	struct sockaddr_storage addr;
	uint32_t err;
};
.Ed
.Pp
.Fa type
is
.Dv MBT_HP_RENDEZVOUS ,
.Dv MBT_HP_CONNECT
or
.Dv MBT_HP_ERROR .
.Fa addr
holds an
.Dv AF_INET
or
.Dv AF_INET6
socket address with the port in network byte order.
.Fa err
is one of
.Dv MBT_HP_ERR_NO_SUCH_PEER ,
.Dv MBT_HP_ERR_NOT_CONNECTED ,
.Dv MBT_HP_ERR_NO_SUPPORT
or
.Dv MBT_HP_ERR_NO_SELF
in an error message, and 0 otherwise.
.Pp
.Fn mbt_hp_encode
writes
.Fa msg
to
.Fa buf ,
which holds
.Fa cap
bytes.
The error code is written only for
.Dv MBT_HP_ERROR
messages.
.Pp
.Fn mbt_hp_decode
parses the
.Fa len
byte payload in
.Fa buf
into
.Fa msg .
The payload must be exactly
.Dv MBT_HP_MSG_V4_LEN
(12) or
.Dv MBT_HP_MSG_V6_LEN
(24) bytes, matching its address type.
Unknown error codes in an error message are passed through.
.Pp
.Fn mbt_hp_type_str
and
.Fn mbt_hp_error_str
return static names for logging, or
.Dq unknown .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn mbt_hp_encode
returns the payload length, or
.Er -EINVAL
for an unknown message type or address family, or
.Er -ENOBUFS
if
.Fa cap
is too small.
.Pp
.Fn mbt_hp_decode
returns 0, or
.Er -EPROTO
if the length does not match the address type, the message or address
type is unknown, or a non-error message carries a nonzero error code.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mbt 3 ,
.Xr mbt_peer 3
.Sh STANDARDS
BEP 55, Holepunch extension.
